   "top": {
    "<P>&nbsp;</P>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; MARGIN: 0pt; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 185%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 29.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp; 생활체육공원(국민체육센터)의 이용자 월 회원 접수를 아래와 같이 실시코자 하오니 많은 참여 바라며, 기타 사항은 관리사무실(532-7173)로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 185%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 27.75pt; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;- 접수기간 : ´09.11. 3일부터(수시접수) </SPAN></P>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 185%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 27.75pt; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; - 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 국민체육센터 안내 데스크</SPAN> </P>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 185%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 27.75pt; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 대상시설 : 체육관, 인공암벽, 게이트볼장</SPAN> </P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;</P>": 1,
    "<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;생활체육공원 주부 테니스교실 회원을 아래와 같이 추가 모집 하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다.</P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . 접수일시 : 11. 3(화) 부터</P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . 접수장소 : 안내 데스크(1층)</P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . 테니스 강사 : 김복언</P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;삼성증권 어린이 교실 지도자 과정 수료(2009)</P>\r,<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 창조테니스장 운영(현재)</P>\r,<P>&nbsp;</P>\r,<P>&nbsp; </P>": 1,
    "<P></P>\r,<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13px\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18px\">프로그램 운영 초빙강사를 아래와 같이 알려 드리오니 참고 바랍니다.</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r,<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">&nbsp;<SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #9334d8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #9334d8\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #9334d8\">&nbsp; -</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px\"><SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #9334d8\"> 요가&nbsp;</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px\"><SPAN style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #9334d8\"> : 조남주 선생님</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; MARGIN: 0pt; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 13.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12px\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12px\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px\">.힐링요가원 전임강사(2005~2006)</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px\"> </SPAN></SPAN>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; MARGIN: 0pt; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 13.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .요가＆테라피 운영(현재) </SPAN></P>\r,<P style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; MARGIN: 0pt; C